],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. On that same middle, January to February 2025 sat at 24% of normal and October to November 2025 at 55%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 67% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 30147 got down to 50% that year.</p>"}
